{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_28","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"civ6","tool":"get_tech_civics","arguments":{},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Researching: Pottery (10 turns)\nCivic: Code of Laws (15 turns)\n\nAvailable techs:\n  Pottery (TECH_POTTERY) [ANCIENT] — 0%, 10 turns -> Granary, Great Bath, Mekewap\n  Animal Husbandry (TECH_ANIMAL_HUSBANDRY) [ANCIENT] — 0%, 10 turns -> Pasture, Camp, Kurgan, Reveals Horses\n  Mining (TECH_MINING) [ANCIENT] — 0%, 10 turns -> Mine, Quarry\n  Sailing (TECH_SAILING) [ANCIENT] — 0%, 19 turns [Boost: Found a city on the Coast.] -> Galley, Viking Longship, Bireme, Fishing Boats, Fishery\n  Astrology (TECH_ASTROLOGY) [ANCIENT] — 0%, 19 turns [Boost: Find a natural wonder.] -> Shrine, Stonehenge, Holy Site, Lavra\n\nAvailable civics:\n  Code of Laws (CIVIC_CODE_OF_LAWS) [ANCIENT] — 0%, 15 turns\n\nLocked techs (prerequisites missing):\n  -- ANCIENT --\n  Irrigation (TECH_IRRIGATION) — needs: Pottery [Boost: Farm a resource.]\n  Archery (TECH_ARCHERY) — needs: Animal Husbandry [Boost: Kill a unit with a Slinger.]\n  Writing (TECH_WRITING) — needs: Pottery [Boost: Meet another civilization.]\n  Masonry (TECH_MASONRY) — needs: Mining [Boost: Build a Quarry.]\n  Bronze Working (TECH_BRONZE_WORKING) — needs: Mining [Boost: Kill 3 Barbarians.]\n  Wheel (TECH_THE_WHEEL) — needs: Mining [Boost: Mine a resource.]\n  -- CLASSICAL --\n  Celestial Navigation (TECH_CELESTIAL_NAVIGATION) — needs: Sailing, Astrology [Boost: Improve 2 sea resources.]\n  Currency (TECH_CURRENCY) — needs: Writing [Boost: Make a [ICON_TradeRoute] Trade Route.]\n  Horseback Riding (TECH_HORSEBACK_RIDING) — needs: Archery [Boost: Build a Pasture.]\n  Iron Working (TECH_IRON_WORKING) — needs: Bronze Working [Boost: Build an Iron Mine.]\n  Shipbuilding (TECH_SHIPBUILDING) — needs: Sailing [Boost: Own 2 Galleys.]\n  Mathematics (TECH_MATHEMATICS) — needs: Currency [Boost: Build 3 different specialty districts.]\n  Construction (TECH_CONSTRUCTION) — needs: Masonry, Horseback Riding [Boost: Build a Water Mill.]\n  Engineering (TECH_ENGINEERING) — needs: Wheel [Boost: Build Ancient Walls.]\n  -- MEDIEVAL --\n  Military Tactics (TECH_MILITARY_TACTICS) — needs: Mathematics [Boost: Kill a unit with a Spearman.]\n  Apprenticeship (TECH_APPRENTICESHIP) — needs: Currency, Horseback Riding [Boost: Build 3 Mines.]\n  Machinery (TECH_MACHINERY) — needs: Iron Working, Engineering [Boost: Own 3 Archers.]\n  Education (TECH_EDUCATION) — needs: Mathematics, Apprenticeship [Boost: Earn a Great Scientist.]\n  Stirrups (TECH_STIRRUPS) — needs: Horseback Riding, Apprenticeship [Boost: Have the Feudalism civic.]\n  Military Engineering (TECH_MILITARY_ENGINEERING) — needs: Construction [Boost: Build an Aqueduct.]\n  Castles (TECH_CASTLES) — needs: Construction [Boost: Adopt a government with 6 inherent policy slots.]\n  Buttress (TECH_BUTTRESS) — needs: Shipbuilding, Mathematics [Boost: Build a Classical era or later wonder]\n\nLocked civics (prerequisites missing):\n  -- ANCIENT --\n  Craftsmanship (CIVIC_CRAFTSMANSHIP) — needs: Code of Laws [Boost: Improve 3 tiles.]\n  Foreign Trade (CIVIC_FOREIGN_TRADE) — needs: Code of Laws [Boost: Discover a second continent.]\n  Military Tradition (CIVIC_MILITARY_TRADITION) — needs: Craftsmanship [Boost: Clear a Barbarian Outpost.]\n  State Workforce (CIVIC_STATE_WORKFORCE) — needs: Craftsmanship [Boost: Build any specialty district.]\n  Early Empire (CIVIC_EARLY_EMPIRE) — needs: Foreign Trade [Boost: Grow your civilization to at least 6 population.]\n  Mysticism (CIVIC_MYSTICISM) — needs: Foreign Trade [Boost: Found a pantheon.]\n  -- CLASSICAL --\n  Games and Recreation (CIVIC_GAMES_RECREATION) — needs: State Workforce [Boost: Research the Construction technology.]\n  Political Philosophy (CIVIC_POLITICAL_PHILOSOPHY) — needs: State Workforce, Early Empire [Boost: Meet 3 city-states.]\n  Drama and Poetry (CIVIC_DRAMA_POETRY) — needs: Early Empire [Boost: Build a wonder.]\n  Military Training (CIVIC_MILITARY_TRAINING) — needs: Military Tradition, Games and Recreation [Boost: Build an Encampment.]\n  Defensive Tactics (CIVIC_DEFENSIVE_TACTICS) — needs: Games and Recreation, Political Philosophy [Boost: Be the target of a Declaration of War.]\n  Recorded History (CIVIC_RECORDED_HISTORY) — needs: Political Philosophy, Drama and Poetry [Boost: Build 2 Campus districts.]\n  Theology (CIVIC_THEOLOGY) — needs: Drama and Poetry, Mysticism [Boost: Found a Religion.]\n  -- MEDIEVAL --\n  Naval Tradition (CIVIC_NAVAL_TRADITION) — needs: Defensive Tactics [Boost: Kill a unit with a Quadrireme.]\n  Feudalism (CIVIC_FEUDALISM) — needs: Defensive Tactics [Boost: Build 6 Farms.]\n  Civil Service (CIVIC_CIVIL_SERVICE) — needs: Defensive Tactics, Recorded History [Boost: Grow a city to 10 population.]\n  Mercenaries (CIVIC_MERCENARIES) — needs: Military Training, Feudalism [Boost: Have 8 land combat units in your military.]\n  Medieval Faires (CIVIC_MEDIEVAL_FAIRES) — needs: Feudalism [Boost: Maintain 4 Trade Routes.]\n  Guilds (CIVIC_GUILDS) — needs: Feudalism, Civil Service [Boost: Build 2 Markets.]\n  Divine Right (CIVIC_DIVINE_RIGHT) — needs: Civil Service, Theology [Boost: Build 2 Temples.]"}],"structured_content":{"result":"Researching: Pottery (10 turns)\nCivic: Code of Laws (15 turns)\n\nAvailable techs:\n  Pottery (TECH_POTTERY) [ANCIENT] — 0%, 10 turns -> Granary, Great Bath, Mekewap\n  Animal Husbandry (TECH_ANIMAL_HUSBANDRY) [ANCIENT] — 0%, 10 turns -> Pasture, Camp, Kurgan, Reveals Horses\n  Mining (TECH_MINING) [ANCIENT] — 0%, 10 turns -> Mine, Quarry\n  Sailing (TECH_SAILING) [ANCIENT] — 0%, 19 turns [Boost: Found a city on the Coast.] -> Galley, Viking Longship, Bireme, Fishing Boats, Fishery\n  Astrology (TECH_ASTROLOGY) [ANCIENT] — 0%, 19 turns [Boost: Find a natural wonder.] -> Shrine, Stonehenge, Holy Site, Lavra\n\nAvailable civics:\n  Code of Laws (CIVIC_CODE_OF_LAWS) [ANCIENT] — 0%, 15 turns\n\nLocked techs (prerequisites missing):\n  -- ANCIE